The files geometry_*.inp are to be used as the geometry.inp file for
geomtesta. 

Because this geometry differs from the normal single-null configuration
expected by readgeometry and readbackground, specific internal changes
were required to those codes. Before compiling readgeometry and 
readbackground, the flag UEDGE_RECT_SLAB must be changed from "0" to "1"
to enable these changes. Be sure to reset those flags to "0" prior
to running the code with other geometries.

To save time, space, and to prepare for the performance benchmark of 
EIRENE, a reduced set of tallies is used for this run. To enable
them, change the flag OPTIMIZE in tallysetup.web from "0" to "1".

The text and primary netCDF output here are for 80,000 flights. The
results from a 4000 flight run are included here as well in
degas2_4000_out.nc.

